{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1774314301,"nonce":"LslFY6Sy3NiJ/Jh+iGhLUg6tqqU=","message":"## Pages UI Implementation Spec (Round 2)\n\n### 1. Sub-tab bar (AnalysisPanel.tsx)\n- Compact horizontal tab bar (h-8 / 32px) at the TOP of the AnalysisPanel, between the BottomShelf header and the canvas area\n- Each tab: page name, small X close button (on hover), double-click to rename inline\n- '+' button at right end to add new page\n- Active tab: emerald accent (bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border-emerald-200)\n- Inactive tabs: text-slate-400, hover:text-slate-600\n- Fixed tab widths (min-w-[80px] max-w-[160px]) to prevent jitter on selection/hover\n- When there are zero pages, auto-create 'Page 1' on mount\n\n### 2. Right sidebar behavior (AnalysisPanel.tsx)\n- When NO analysis node is selected: show AnalysisPageSettings\n- When a node IS selected: show node properties (existing behavior)\n- Sidebar width stays at w-64 in both modes\n\n### 3. AnalysisPageSettings.tsx (new component)\n- Page name: editable text input\n- Eval parametrization section with:\n  - Perturbation type dropdown (curl_field, constant_field, gusts, feedback_impulse, unit_stim)\n  - Perturbation amplitudes (comma-separated number input)\n  - SISU values (comma-separated number input)\n  - Task variants (key-value pair editor with add/remove)\n- All changes go through setEvalParams() and renamePage() on the store","files":null}]}